title: reveal
---
Host: Now that our contestant has made their choice
Host: let's reveal our eligible singles!
Host: Here they are:
<<if $drac != 1000>>
    <<reveal drac>>
    Host: Dr. h.c. Acula!
    Dr. h.c. Acula: Let's have a bloody good time.
<<elseif $witch != 1000>>
    <<reveal witch>>
    Host: Bobo Blocksberg!
    Bobo Blocksberg: Magic is not the only thing I am wickedly talented at.
<<elseif $moth != 1000>>
    <<reveal moth>>
    Host: Mothperson!
    Mothperson: Lämp.
<<elseif $fish != 1000>>
    <<reveal fish>>
    Host: Fishy McFishface!
    Fishy McFishface: Yes, that is an eel in my pocket.
<<elseif $mum != 1000>>
    Host: Muscle Mummy!
    <<reveal mum>>
    Muscle Mummy: I'll be your crush.
<<endif>>
Host: Aaaaaand...
<<reveal ghost>>
Host: A... ghost? How did you get into the show?
Ghost: Boo!
The Ghost floats through a wall.
Effervescent.
===